    "chunk_text": "mne onleat, \u00feonne onleat seo n\u00e6ddre. JY10B14 \u00d0a gelyfde se wyrmgaldere to gode \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t wundor, ond he sealde his feorh for Criste JY10C1 On \u00f0one ilcan d\u00e6g bi\u00f0 \u00feara haligra gesweostra \u00f0rowung sancta Rubne ond sancta Secunde, JY10C3 \u00dea \u00ferowedon merne martyrdom for Criste on Decies dagum \u00fe\u00e6s caseres. JY10C5 Sum c\u00e6mpena ealdormon hi het weorpan on Tibre flod. JY10C6 \u00dea ne meahton hi on \u00f0\u00e6m w\u00e6tere gesincan \u00feurh Cristes miht, ah hi s\u00e6ton ufan on \u00f0\u00e6m swa JY14A1 On \u00f0one feowerteg\u00f0an d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s miclan martyres gemynd se is nemned JY14A3 He w\u00e6s biscop on \u00f0\u00e6re m\u00e6g\u00f0e \u00f0e Pontus is nemned, ac Traianus se casere hine \u00f0reade mid JY14A6 Ond \u00e6t nehstan he het hine sendan on byrnendne ofn, ond on \u00f0\u00e6m he onsende his gast. JY14A7 Ond \u00f0rym dagum \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he \u00e6teawde beforan \u00fe\u00e6s caseres dura ond cleopade to \u00fe\u00e6m JY14A12 \u00deeosses biscopes reliquias syndon on Galwala m\u00e6g\u00f0e on Mennia \u00f0\u00e6re ceastre, ond \u00fea JY15A1 On \u00f0one fifteg\u00f0an d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 sancte Cyrices tid \u00fe\u00e6s halgan cildes ond sancte JY15A3 Hi \u00ferowedon swi\u00f0e m\u00e6rne martyrdom for Criste. JY15A4 Alexander se gerefa het hi gefon on \u00f0\u00e6re ceastre \u00f0e",
